    <div style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</div>
    <div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;">Proposal No.&#160;7: The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved an amendment to our Certificate of Incorporation to, at the discretion of the Board, effect a reverse stock split of our outstanding shares of Common Stock, at a ratio, ranging from one-for-three (1:3) to one-for-ten (1:10), with the exact ratio to be set within that range at the discretion of our Board of Directors without further approval or authorization of our stockholders. The votes on this proposal were as follows:</div>
