    <div style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-align:justify;">Proposal No.&#160;8: The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved a proposal to adjourn the Annual Meeting, if necessary, to solicit additional proxies if there were insufficient votes at the time of the Annual Meeting to approve Proposals Four, Five, Six, or Seven.&#160;</div>
